I attempted to bring up NetBSD 10.1 on an Alphaserver 1000 5/300, but it =
failed immediately after kernel start. The 5/300 has a 21164 (no A), =
meaning it does not have BWX. I know that Linux recently removed support =
for processors without BWX, has NetBSD done the same?



